              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "Extract the facts from this evidence item."
            },
            {
              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"34d697e9ed4ae99837bd322b45a995de7258fc6baf2c2665051287727e232dd2\" kind=\"text\" label=\"scope evidence\">\nOrder form — agreed by Nara of Rimba Looms, Indonesia, and buyer Elin on 3 June\n\n- Deliver 20 handloom cotton scarves.\n- Include a care card with each scarf.\n- Use cotton dyed with plant-based indigo.\n- Pack the scarves in two reusable cloth bags.\n\nTotal agreed price: USD 240, including packing and delivery. Payment is due in USD through PayPal before dispatch. The buyer requested the scarves for a small shop display; no individual gift wrapping was requested. Both parties accepted these requirements in their order messages.\n</evidence>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
